{
  "name": "hudson-of-wages",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Hudson of Wages: certified payroll lines against the wage rates of the job's wage determination: hourly cash plus fringe below the rate for the classification, overtime not paid as overtime, classifications with no rate, missing worker ids, full Social Security numbers on the report, and lines entered twice. Worker names and ids are masked in what the AI model sees. Drafts payroll corrections. Never submits payroll or pays anyone.",
